{"blob":"221880d7da0875bdfb88f4594f01e6b31fd57be9","commit":"ff534ffc616cdb6898aca3e3f09b18cceac13823","deleted":false,"heading":"HTML 基础 › 初识 HTML › HTML 图片 › 图片超链接","id":"source-d0103f9466a8ed8f767d04ebeae218f6e3ec53e3449f139e","path":"Learn/Language/Fronted/HTML.md","section":{"before":"##### 图片超链接\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n        <title> This is the page title </title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <p>you can click the sun or other plant watch the changes</p>\n        <img src=\"./src/imgs/planets.gif\" alt=\"a picture of 3 planets\" width=\"145\" height=\"126\" usemap=\"#plants_map\">\n        <map name=\"plants_map\">\n            <area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"0,0,82,126\" href=\"src/html/sun.html\"/>\n            <area shape=\"circle\" coords=\"90,58,3\"  href=\"./src/imgs/merglobe.gif\"/>\n            <area shape=\"circle\" coords=\"124,59,8\" href=\"./src/imgs/venglobe.gif\"/>\n        </map>\n        <p> you can click anyone of them</p>\n    </body>\n</html>\n```\n- 唯一要注意的就是使用图片布局时名称前要加 `#`\n- 图片中描述属性 `alt` 可以不加\n每个图片的 html 网页如下\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n        <title>a sun page</title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <img src=\"../imgs/sun.gif\" alt=\"a picture of mercur\">\n    </body>\n</html>\n```\n文件树结构如下：\n![[Pasted image 20250113191334.png]]","end_line":397,"hash":"979e54aa1379baee28f2d9af7f27d4a9dcd5b737176419e82c1d6c06ad70552f","heading":"HTML 基础 › 初识 HTML › HTML 图片 › 图片超链接","key":"HTML 基础 › 初识 HTML › HTML 图片 › 图片超链接","kind":"modified","line":360,"text":"##### 图片超链接\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n        <title> This is the page title </title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <p>you can click the sun or other plant watch the changes</p>\n        <img src=\"./src/imgs/planets.gif\" alt=\"a picture of 3 planets\" width=\"145\" height=\"126\" usemap=\"#plants_map\">\n        <map name=\"plants_map\">\n            <area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"0,0,82,126\" href=\"src/html/sun.html\"/>\n            <area shape=\"circle\" coords=\"90,58,3\"  href=\"./src/imgs/merglobe.gif\"/>\n            <area shape=\"circle\" coords=\"124,59,8\" href=\"./src/imgs/venglobe.gif\"/>\n        </map>\n        <p> you can click anyone of them</p>\n    </body>\n</html>\n```\n- 唯一要注意的就是使用图片布局时名称前要加 `#`\n- 图片中描述属性 `alt` 可以不加\n每个图片的 html 网页如下\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n        <title>a sun page</title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <img src=\"../imgs/sun.gif\" alt=\"a picture of mercur\">\n    </body>\n</html>\n```\n文件树结构如下：\n![Pasted image 20250113191334](../../../Files%20%26%20LongText/Attachments/Pasted%20image%2020250113191334.png)"},"text":"##### 图片超链接\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n        <title> This is the page title </title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <p>you can click the sun or other plant watch the changes</p>\n        <img src=\"./src/imgs/planets.gif\" alt=\"a picture of 3 planets\" width=\"145\" height=\"126\" usemap=\"#plants_map\">\n        <map name=\"plants_map\">\n            <area shape=\"rect\" coords=\"0,0,82,126\" href=\"src/html/sun.html\"/>\n            <area shape=\"circle\" coords=\"90,58,3\"  href=\"./src/imgs/merglobe.gif\"/>\n            <area shape=\"circle\" coords=\"124,59,8\" href=\"./src/imgs/venglobe.gif\"/>\n        </map>\n        <p> you can click anyone of them</p>\n    </body>\n</html>\n```\n- 唯一要注意的就是使用图片布局时名称前要加 `#`\n- 图片中描述属性 `alt` 可以不加\n每个图片的 html 网页如下\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n        <title>a sun page</title>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <img src=\"../imgs/sun.gif\" alt=\"a picture of mercur\">\n    </body>\n</html>\n```\n文件树结构如下：\n!